# Which functions does "Housing and supporting combustion" depend on?

PREFIX : <https://w3id.org/ZorroOntology#>
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>

SELECT ?function ?dependency
WHERE {
  ?function rdfs:label "Housing and supporting combustion" ;
            :dependsOn ?dependency .
}
